comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T00:15:31.183Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all statuses for read, notes, omission_receipt, and duplicate writes. pm-0k19l7, pm-p258tx, pm-3esl28, and pm-b1w8vr are completed adjacent projection work; none owns the pm read receipt mismatch reported in GH-941."
  "2026-08-09T07:13:21.819Z","harness:codex","Calibration evidence: expanding get omission truth from three top-level groups to thirteen restorable body, collection, and section groups adds a constant 515 bytes / 129 measured tokens to the standard get receipt; the approved calibration preserves the same 20k session budget and remains below its ceiling."
  "2026-08-09T08:05:18.202Z","harness:codex","Final evidence: linked output-projection tests pass; clean tarball consumer default get returned a property-aware receipt with 11 genuinely omitted groups while preserving included linked and claim_state sections; full repository coverage is exact 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-08-09T09:24:01.215Z","harness:codex","PR #947 review hardening: get projection completeness now tests own-property presence, so an explicitly present undefined field is distinguished from an omitted field. The focused regression covers this shape, and the calibrated output-contract documentation now matches the generated 2-item and 2,243-item measurements."
  "2026-08-09T09:54:51.947Z","harness:codex","Delivery review: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/947 carries this item's implementation, tests, documentation, generated contracts, and hosted review corrections on branch feat/sdk-context-read-remediation-replication."
  "2026-08-09T10:27:54.611Z","harness:codex","Hosted-gate calibration evidence: the exact seeded returning-agent get now emits 2,388 bytes / 597 estimated tokens because the completed GH-941 contract adds truthful restorable omission groups. The other three independently measured scenarios remain byte-for-byte at 626, 1,231, and 197 tokens. Refreshed the published baseline through pnpm quality:agent-task-token:update, then the normal gate and its executable million-token negative control passed; composite 2,651 remains far below the 20k session budget."
